{"name":"Cupcake","hex":"#8a6e53","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cupcake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small cake baked in a usually paper container shaped like a cup, often with icing on top.","An attractive young woman."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To flirt; to talk or act amorously or intimately.","To flirt with; to talk or act amorously or intimately to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cupcake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cupcake","blocks":[{"text":"A cupcake, fairy cake (BrE), patty cake (AuE), or bun (IrE) is a small cake designed to serve one person, which may be baked in a small thin paper or aluminum cup. As with larger cakes, frosting, icing and various other cake decorations such as fruit and candy may be applied."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg/330px-Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cupcake","wikidata":"Q816851"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg/500px-Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg/1280px-Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg/500px-Unfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Unfrosted cupcakes","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUnfrosted_Cupcakes.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Hostess-Cupcake-Whole.jpg/500px-Hostess-Cupcake-Whole.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikim